    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 195,
        "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. This is our weekly data review for the Bridge Language Centre. Let's start with the numbers from last month. Ben, can you walk us through the attendance figures?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3dfa7e81e93a8acb84b0f28e07ad0ea368e500a181c46fbc61189f5c95e0a389",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 202,
        "sourceEnd": 414,
        "text": "Sure. Overall attendance was 82 percent, which is four points higher than the previous month. But I should mention that the evening classes were lower, at 76 percent, while the morning classes reached 88 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "7e64703c5fd0dc1d9c7d361094b2ee0f523193640f9060ccdb81469f745d286c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 421,
        "sourceEnd": 454,
        "text": "That's a big gap. Do we know why?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "59106fe2b0734fe40bb377398ea13c4fc5555f5e3e812946aebf8936937ea6f3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 461,
        "sourceEnd": 657,
        "text": "Partly. The evening classes had more students who work during the day, and some of them missed classes because of overtime. Also, one teacher was sick for a week, and those classes were cancelled.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "3688a437359af013f00a0d0a8cf00b77bbd0007e41e916e6dd5b2fcb7f3ee004",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 664,
        "sourceEnd": 811,
        "text": "OK. And what about the test scores? I saw the average score for the mid-term test was 71, compared with 68 last term. That's an improvement, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "2972c60f84ddb9f220fe7037490274d97254e4295e389e0b6a3bfb20f407c611",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 818,
        "sourceEnd": 1001,
        "text": "Yes, but we need to be careful. The number of students who took the test was smaller this time—only 45 students, compared with 60 last term. So the average might not be very reliable.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0a8a64b5cb61cdbce11c86bf50fc39ead44e0bbd575384a94d59a46302776173",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1008,
        "sourceEnd": 1070,
        "text": "Good point. So we shouldn't compare the two averages directly?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "1676f2681bdb52b55d9223e7545664b221d749eda762230c1e7410c3b1bfcab1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1077,
        "sourceEnd": 1240,
        "text": "Exactly. It's better to look at the same group of students. For the 30 students who took both tests, their average went up from 65 to 74. That's a clearer picture.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1987f1f153a5bdf4da7b2669be957be1183d649c607c96b5b686dda43e6b233f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1247,
        "sourceEnd": 1600,
        "text": "That's a nine-point increase for that group. Much more useful. Now, let's talk about the survey. We asked students about their favourite class activities. The most popular was group discussion, chosen by 40 percent of students. The second most popular was watching videos, at 25 percent. And grammar exercises were the least popular, at only 10 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "0d35036fbb748c9cf016130b048fe90c6331543c1a8725a5e0051c0c19ae13ad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1607,
        "sourceEnd": 1793,
        "text": "That doesn't surprise me. But I think we should also look at the comments. Several students said they wanted more speaking practice, and a few mentioned that the classroom was too noisy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "343479bc90862c65308d5bf8ef677cb96941e0ad018a47844ae768728f99d038",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1800,
        "sourceEnd": 1949,
        "text": "Right. So for next term, we could add more speaking activities and maybe move the noisy classes to a quieter room. Any other data we need to discuss?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "9bbcc3ec31018a56353ebe5fd2b964baf51de7594622b79914fdda862ae26439",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1956,
        "sourceEnd": 2099,
        "text": "Yes, the homework completion rate. It was 90 percent for morning classes but only 70 percent for evening classes. That's a 20-point difference.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "196c2d44797d7f27356b791bdfd7014fb160e37e56963a5afe6a928b89638df8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 2106,
        "sourceEnd": 2308,
        "text": "That's significant. Let's set a target: we want to raise the evening homework completion rate to 80 percent by the end of next term. And we'll check the attendance again in four weeks. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "0c837c560ee43ba89800686fd0015c18c3d2ee35e8e27aaf5ef665ef4c1ecf71",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
